<urn:usf:rule:local-preparation-basis:1> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Resolve exactly one selected WorkPacket, contract and RealisationProfile from rootIdentity and manifestPath, then use deriveWork and deriveCurrentRealisationBasis. Preserve the exact immutable basis; reject missing, stale or ambiguous scope and caller-provided authority overrides." <urn:usf:graph:cli-transition-definition> .
