<urn:usf:rule:local-preparation-input:1> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Use existing bounded --input JSON transport only. Validate rootIdentity, manifestPath and proposed operations against the graph-generated localPreparationRequest schema. Permit no additional properties or supplied basis/preimage/provider facts. Derive utf8 when encoding is omitted. Bound aggregate proposed content to 1048576 UTF-8 bytes and at most 64 distinct operations; transport remains capped by the existing 4 MiB command-input boundary." <urn:usf:graph:cli-transition-definition> .
