<urn:usf:rule:local-preparation-guard:1> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Require current construction eligibility and explicit selected-contract local-authored source and preparation-algorithm requirements. Requirement/dependency digests must match the immutable basis. Preparation is no-effect observation, not provider dispatch, acceptance or permission publication." <urn:usf:graph:cli-transition-definition> .
