<urn:usf:rule:local-preparation-scope:1> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Derive current semantic reads and exact file preimages from the selected work/basis and proposed operation paths. Reobserve bounded no-follow source identities before output; refuse unsafe links, file movement, unsupported files and undeclared paths. Empty static scope arrays do not assert that context-derived scopes are empty; operational scope derivation remains mandatory." <urn:usf:graph:cli-transition-definition> .
