<urn:usf:rule:local-preparation-digest:1> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Use canonical localContributionDigest over the closed local wire record excluding only its artifactDigest field; bind basisDigest, sorted distinct operations, derived preimages and observed toolDigest. Replay identical current inputs produces the same identity; content/basis changes produce a new proposal." <urn:usf:graph:cli-transition-definition> .
<urn:usf:rule:local-preparation-intent:1> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:CliFieldDerivationRule> <urn:usf:graph:cli-transition-definition> .
